	"data": "Benefits Annexure - IL\n\nAttachment 5\nBenefits at a Glance\n\nInfosys offers the following benefit programs to regular, full-time employees on U.S. payroll. The information below is\nan overview of the benefit programs and is not an exhaustive list of all benefits offered by Infosys. This document\ndescribes the benefits as of the date of your offer letter. The Company’s benefits may be modified or eliminated in\nthe future at the Company’s discretion at any time, with or without notice. Please…",
